eAMFcQ7kNvwG5wgKL&_nc_oc=AdmRHV15deR5DPX0zSdPU0KtSauQPePMBVgFgyYBgDYTC-PQ-NpxBFFhwkLQC5gikJw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aftf2PEaOygWBbfD0FOJYwAlIjG5O8oBF2eZvkJ9YrqvhQ&oe=69A6E178"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail.png", "id": "794121865642317", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035334_794121868975650_8463868109182604137_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SRjF3B-HMPcQ7kNvwFKM-p0&_nc_oc=Adkl6rYmkGG3YpaF3SBtXoyoeWH1PhvOvhijKlurFfZC57S6rTB56EjnS2iV44O0rqQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfutGSsKVCHq7HFXdG0bHnXsXD-w9LDyeW42bRqSCldhyQ&oe=69A6F483"}, "display_name": "BattleGlide", "keywords": [], "long_description": "BattleGlide is an open world sandbox game where you can move and fight like a super hero.\n\n- Explore a lively and open city by rope swinging, jumping, and climbing walls. Choose the time of day you want to fight crime: day, night, and evening.\n\n- Take down criminals in countless creative ways, including grabbing, shooting, punching, disarming, or dropping them from the tallest skyscraper...\n\n- Handle weapons realistically. Disarm your enemies or give them a taste of their own medicine!\n\n- Use a variety of weapons to take down your enemies: fists, pistols, assault rifles, large props, baseball bats, explosives, and even frying pans.", "short_description": "BattleGlide is an open world sandbox game where you can move and fight like a super hero.\n\n- Explore a lively and open city by rope swinging, and climbing walls, during the night, day and also evening.\n\n- Take down criminals in countless creative ways, including grabbing, shooting, punching, disarming, or dropping them from the tallest skyscraper...\n\n- Use a variety of weapons to take down your enemies: fists, pistols, assault rifles, large props, baseball bats, explosives, and even frying pans."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ba